# RESTLESS: the nineteen foes and their hit points (the original's): lackey
# 6, spitbloom 42, starspitter 20, hive 24, gnat 1, wisp 6, tumbler 6, bog
# toad 10, boulderkin 24, shellcrab 1, leaper 1, weeper 20, shade 6,
# gloomcrow 42, firemaw 42, shieldling 1, hulk 80, clockfire 5, stormcloud
# 42. A shellcrab hit only rolls over and gets up again; a weeper takes no
# harm with its eye shut; a shieldling's shield stops shots from the front;
# a hive lets out gnats; four wisps beaten drop a gold jar.
game restless
wait 5
cheat half 0
cheat nospawn
cheat notimer
cheat god
cheat clear
cheat foe 1 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 1
expect foe0_hp == 6
expect hp_of_1 == 6
cheat clear
cheat foe 2 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 2
expect foe0_hp == 42
expect hp_of_2 == 42
cheat clear
cheat foe 3 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 3
expect foe0_hp == 20
expect hp_of_3 == 20
cheat clear
cheat foe 4 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 4
expect foe0_hp == 24
expect hp_of_4 == 24
cheat clear
cheat foe 5 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 5
expect foe0_hp == 1
expect hp_of_5 == 1
cheat clear
cheat foe 6 260 60
expect foe0_kind == 6
expect foe0_hp == 6
expect hp_of_6 == 6
cheat clear
